 can be reused in the next cycle (FR-11, FR-14). Substitutions are recorded in the delivered items (Deliveries)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fontSize=13;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#E17E00;fontColor=#262626;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="790" width="1000" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
